flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Prepare count query by user_id]
    B --> C[Open DB connection]
    C --> D[Bind user ID]
    D --> E[Execute query]
    E --> F{Result row exists?}
    F -- Yes --> G{Count < 3?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Return true]
    G -- No --> I[Return false]
    F -- No --> I
    C --> J[On SQL error print stack trace]
    J --> I
    H --> K[End]
    I --> K
